    {"id":"docs_svimodel_svimodel_extended_surface_svi","label":"Extended Surface SVI (eSSVI)","file_type":"concept","source_file":"Docs/SviModel/svimodel.tex","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"The documented arbitrage-free guarantees are derived in a Black-76 / risk-free-discount setting; for CDS options the correct numeraire is the risky annuity rpv01(T), so calendar- and butterfly-arbitrage-free conditions only hold approximately for CDS surfaces, weakening for high-yield or distressed names where rpv01(T) diverges further from B(0,T)."}
